r free.</p><p>With the Plus Plan, student orgs can upload unlimited blocks & file, add members to their workspace, 30-day page history, up to 100 guests and more – free of charge.</p><p><italic><bold>Note:</bold> This discount is only eligible for workspaces for volunteer student organisations. Workspaces that are not designated for student organisations will not qualify for the discount.</italic></p>","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.answer2V2":"<p>At Notion, we believe that people think better, dream bigger and lead stronger, together.</p><p>By offering Notion for free to student organisations, we want to <bold>empower our next generation of thinkers, dreamers and leaders to do their best work together.</bold></p>","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.answer3V2":"<p>1. Submit an application representing a student-led organisation at a verified institution.</p><p>2. All applicants must provide their official education email address from their university.</p><p>3. Only one application per student club or organisation will be approved.</p><p>4. Your club/organisation must be recognised by your school. In your application, please provide a link for your organisation on your school’s website.</p><p>5. Workspaces on a paid subscription are not eligible for the offer. Please ensure that the workspace you select in this application is on a Free plan first before applying.</p>","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.answer6":"Our team will contact you once your application has been reviewed! If you’ve been approved for the discount, your workspace will be upgraded.","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.answer7":"We are not offering our student orgs discount to secondary schools at this time.","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.answer9":"<p>Yes! We currently offer our 1-member Plus Plan for free to students.</p><p>Learn more about our Notion for education programme <link>here</link>.</p>","studentGroupSignup.studentGroupFaq.question1":"What is the student org discount?","stu