viewGuide":"Interview Guide","templateHelpers.useCase.interviewGuide.description":"Use this template to prepare your job candidates for their interviews and offer them helpful resources like videos, links, schedules and more.","templateHelpers.useCase.investorUpdate":"Investor Update","templateHelpers.useCase.investorUpdate.description":"Instead of sending the usual disorganised email updates to your investors, use this template to offer them a more comprehensive and digestible look at your company’s progress.","templateHelpers.useCase.jobApplication.description":"Keep track of the entire job application process all in one page. Easily add customised resumes, cover letters and portfolio’s while keeping track of companies you’ve contacted.","templateHelpers.useCase.journal.description":"Document your life – daily happenings, special occasions and reflections on your goals. Categorise entries with tags and automatically capture the date.","templateHelpers.useCase.lessonPlans.description":"These lesson plans are based on Harvard Business School’s Elements of Effective Class Preparation. This makes it easy to track their status, keep all related notes in one place and make progress.","templateHelpers.useCase.lifeWiki.description":"Plan and keep track of your entire life with this comprehensive dashboard. Take charge of your growth with setting goals, tracking daily habits and maintaining a log of everything you’re reading.","templateHelpers.useCase.meetingNotes":"Meeting notes","templateHelpers.useCase.oneOnOneNotes":"1:1 Notes","templateHelpers.useCase.oneOnOneNotes.description":"This template is perfect for keeping all of your 1:1 notes and docs in one place. You can add dates to each meeting and even tick off action items as the week progresses.","templateHelpers.useCase.peopleDirectory":"People Directory","templateHelpers.useCase.peopleDirectory.description":"Help your team keep track of whose who with this simple template. Each card can be updated to store an emplo